# into this file.
# Added here: Noboru the Cudgel (1392).
# Left out: Deep Sea Salvage (662), Sunken Treasure (666), Sunken Treasure (668), Sunken Treasure (669).

step Fly to Darkshire
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  goto 27.5,77.7 "Booty Bay flight master"
  fly "Darkshire"
  zone Duskwood

# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: The Perenolde Tiara (543); Plea to the Alliance (634) handed in at Refuge Pointe; MacKreel's Moonshine (647),
# moved from 01-hillsbrad-foothills for its 15-minute limit: taken after Kor'gresh, handed in straight off the Refuge Pointe flight (#1319).
# My Little Friends (93176) is optional (#1314): nobody has been recorded taking it, and Amaryllis Webb was never seen.
# Assassin's Contract (522) is optional (#1542): the contract drops only from the Shadowy Assassin, a single stealthed mob on
# Southshore's edge that few players find, so the Southshore step never waits for him.
# Level tidy (0.4.0): the Syndicate camp (Syndicate Assassins 505 and its documents 510, 511) is worked here at about 37, on the
# way from Southshore to Arathi, instead of at 31-32 in 01-hillsbrad-foothills (Syndicate Thieves 33-34, Wizards 34-35);
# Magistrate Maleb's quest is taken on 01's Southshore stop and carried here (this Southshore stop takes it if 01 didn't).
# Noble Deaths (512) and Letter to Stormpike (514) follow on this guide's Southshore and Ironforge stops. The Stone of
# East Binding's key is taken after Kinelory's errand, at about 38. Left out at 38: Dark Council (537, Nagaz 40, who
# also guards the Ensorcelled Parchment, 551) and Baron's Demise (523, Baron Vardus 40). Faldir's Cove (662-669) is a
# group choice: its naga are 38-40 and two level 40 water elementals ambush Phizzlethorpe's escort.
# Since the 0.3.7 audit: Refuge Pointe's hand-ins come on the walk from Go'Shek Farm to the Stone of West Binding, and the
# Swamp of Sorrows ends Harborage, then Watcher Biggs, on the road out.
# Left out: A Meal Served Cold (212): its 30-minute limit can't last from Stormwind to the Cold Eye Basilisks in Stranglethorn and back.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Swamp of Sorrows

step Swamp of Sorrows
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  goto 26.7,59.8 "Swamp of Sorrows"

step Watcher Biggs
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Amaryllis Webb may not be here on Forever: if Amaryllis Webb doesn't offer My Little Friends, skip it.
  accept 1396 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Watcher Biggs
  accept 93176 optional               -- Amaryllis Webb: three critters to catch in Arathi, Desolace and Stranglethorn

step The western swamp
  tip Young crocolisks, Sorrow Spinners and Swamp Jaguars all roam the swamp around the road.
  kill 1084 quest 1396.1 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Young Sawtooth Crocolisk
  kill 858 quest 1396.2 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Sorrow Spinner
  kill 767 quest 1396.3 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Swamp Jaguar

step Watcher Biggs
  turnin 1396 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  accept 1421 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Father Tuttle
  tip North-west of Watcher Biggs, Father Tuttle (level 34) waits by the road: lead him north to the Harborage, on your way there. Stay close to him and clear what attacks him; if he falls, abandon the quest and go on.
  accept 93585 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Father Tuttle

step The Harborage
  tip Follow the road north to the draenei of the Harborage. Karana and Pelluk stand beside Magtoor: their Lost Ones are the ones you meet in the Fallow Sanctuary anyway.
  accept 1389 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Magtoor
  accept 93429                        -- Karana
  accept 93430                        -- Pelluk

step Father Tuttle
  goto 26.0,31.7
  complete 93585 @26.0,31.7 map 1435 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step The Harborage
  turnin 93585 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Magtoor: Father Tuttle's escort

step Fallow Sanctuary
  tip East along the road to the Fallow Sanctuary. The Draenethyst Crystals are the glowing blue crystals among the Lost Ones' tents: click them. Any Lost One counts for Karana, and the Lost One Fishermen on the sanctuary's west side carry Pelluk's Lucky Lure. Noboru the Cudgel walks a long path through the ruins; his cudgel starts a quest for Magtoor. Don't wait for him.
  collect 6071 quest 1389 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Draenethyst Crystal, the blue crystals by the tents
  collect 258530 quest 93430          -- Lucky Lure, from a Lost One Fisherman
  kill 759 x10 quest 93429            -- Lost Ones: Hunters, Muckdwellers, Seers and Riftseekers all count

step The Lost Caravan
  tip The wrecked caravan's chest lies at the north end of the Fallow Sanctuary, beside Galen Goodward's cage.
  tip Careful: The camp is full of Lost Ones around level 38. They stand in linked groups of 2-3, many are casters, and they respawn quickly.
  collect 6170 quest 1421 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Wizards' Reagents

step Galen Goodward
  tip Galen is caged at the north end of the sanctuary. Free him and keep him alive on the walk out; his strongbox waits by the road afterwards. Careful: on the walk out the camp's Lost One Riftseekers (37-38) and their pets, with the Lost Ones around them, turn on Galen: clear the cage and the start of his path first, stay beside him and pull every attacker onto yourself. Many players lose him the first time; if he dies, abandon the quest and take it again at his cage.
  accept 1393 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  complete 1393 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  turnin 1393 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Galen's Strongbox

step Noboru's Cudgel
  tip Careful: Noboru is level 39, two over you here: fight him only with a friend or from level 38; otherwise let him pass.
  collect 6196 x1 optional @55.7,34.4 map 1435
  accept 1392 optional only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Magtoor
  when onquest 1392
  turnin 1392 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step The Harborage
  tip West along the road from Galen's strongbox to the Harborage.
  turnin 1389 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  accept 93464                        -- Magtoor: The Visiting Mage, for Azore Aldamort in Desolace, on the Desolace guide at the end of 30-40
  turnin 93429                        -- Karana
  turnin 93430                        -- Pelluk

step Watcher Biggs
  tip South down the road to Watcher Biggs, on the way west out of the swamp.
  turnin 1421 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

