step The Binding
  only Warlock
  tip Gakin the Darkbinder waits in the Slaughtered Lamb's cellar, in the Mage Quarter. Use the Heartswood Core at the summoning circle there and defeat the succubus it calls. If you took What Is Love?, hand him the Wooden Figurine too, place it at the same circle and defeat the incubus.
  turnin 1738                         -- Gakin the Darkbinder
  accept 1739
  kill 5677 quest 1739.1 @39.2,84.4 live -- Summoned Succubus, at the summoning circle
  turnin 1739                         -- Summon Succubus
  turnin 65602 optional only Gnome,Human -- What Is Love?, if you took it
  accept 65603 optional only Gnome,Human
  kill 185335 quest 65603.1 optional only Gnome,Human -- Summoned Incubus, at the same circle
  turnin 65603 optional only Gnome,Human -- Gakin binds the incubus to you

step Class training
  only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock,Druid
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Your level 34 ranks: the class trainers stand around the Trade District, Old Town, the Cathedral and the Mage Quarter; Sheldras Moontree, the druid trainer, stands north-west of the Mage Quarter. Shamans train in Ironforge, later in 30-40.
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock,Druid

