  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip North out of Southshore to the Syndicate camp on the Alterac border, west of Tarren Mill (Horde): its Footpads and Thieves are the Syndicate Maleb wants, and the documents lie in the camp. Then back to the road and east to Arathi.
  tip Careful: a few Syndicate Wizards (34-35) stand among the tents and cast from range: pull them one at a time.
