step Northfold Manor
  tip The Syndicate hold the farm north-west of Refuge Pointe.
  tip Careful: Syndicate Highwaymen are level 30-31 and can cast Sneak while out of combat, so they are often stealthed and hard to spot.
  kill 2586 quest 681.1 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Syndicate Highwayman
  kill 2589 quest 681.2 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Syndicate Mercenary

step Hay Weevil
  when onquest 93176
  tip Hay Weevils crawl about the north end of Northfold Manor's farm: catch one with the tool from Amaryllis Webb's Entomology Starter Kit.
  collect 213568 "Hay Weevil Specimen" @31.3,27.2

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Myzrael story

step Shards of Myzrael
  tip East from Northfold Manor across the north of the Highlands; the shards glitter on the hill by the Circle of East Binding, north of Go'Shek Farm.
  turnin 635 optional                 -- Only if Gluggle gave you the pendant in Stranglethorn
  accept 642 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Arathi Highlands: kill these as you meet them
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip The Drywhisker kobolds dig in the gorge east of Hammerfall (Horde); skirt the town to the north. They drop the Motes of Myzrael, not Krazek's ore. Lesser Bloodstone Deposits need Mining 75: mine four ore, buy them at the Auction House, or ask a miner friend. The ore goal is optional; continue with Myzrael if you cannot get it. Careful: Every kobold type runs off for help when low on health (Kobolds at 30%, Surveyors and Diggers at 15%), which can pull more of them.
  collect 4278 quest 627 optional only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Lesser Bloodstone Ore
  collect 4435 quest 642 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Mote of Myzrael from Drywhisker Kobold, Drywhisker Surveyor and Drywhisker Digger, by this stop

step Iridescent Shards
  tip The shards lie at the far end of Drywhisker Gorge.
  turnin 642 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Below ground

step Iridescent Shards
  when group 651
  tip Stones of Binding is a group quest at this level: three Cresting Exiles (38-39) guard the Stone of East Binding and attack together. Grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Skip it if you are alone.
  accept 651                          -- Below ground

step Witherbark Village
  tip South from the Stone of East Binding, past Go'Shek Farm, to Witherbark Village in the hills: the Witch Doctors stand among the huts and the Shadow Hunters guard the far end of the valley. Every troll can drop a tusk.
  collect 4503 quest 691.1 @68.3,75.2 map 1417 era only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Witherbark Tusk; below ground
  collect 4522 quest 691.2 @68.3,75.2 map 1417 era only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Witherbark Medicine Pouch
  collect 5040 quest 691.3 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Shadow Hunter Knife; below ground

